From: Chris F Ravenscroft <chris@voilaweb.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:09:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/20] local: a coordinator script that fails in the
 background shows a toast (run-or-toast.sh, mods/toasts); restart.sh says when
 Herdr started no agent

